cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CREST: Creativity of Research Agents"
abstract: >-
  CREST (Creativity of Research Agents) is a benchmark that measures the
  creativity of deep research agents and AI scientist papers. It generates and
  caches answers to the same research questions from deep research systems
  (Caesar, OpenAI Responses with hosted web search, Google Deep Research,
  Anthropic Opus 5.5 with client-side search, and GPT Researcher), compares
  them with pairwise LLM-as-a-judge judgments guided by New, Useful, Surprising
  (NUS) rubrics, and produces creativity rankings with saved judgments,
  configurations, timing, and API costs. A companion pipeline applies the same
  pairwise judging to papers released by AI scientist systems.
authors:
